# A heater phase phi in one arm sends sin^2(phi/2) = 0.250 of the power to the bar port.

title Mach-Zehnder switch, phase 0.333 pi
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.5 1.6 21

comp c1 coupler kappa=0.5
comp c2 coupler kappa=0.5
comp a waveguide length=100.0
comp b waveguide length=100.0
comp h phase phi=1.047197551197
link c1.3 a.1
link c1.4 b.1
port in c1.1
port in2 c1.2
port bar c2.3
port cross c2.4
link a.2 h.1
link h.2 c2.1
link b.2 c2.2

expect lossless
expect level bar 1.55 -6.02059991 1e-6
expect level cross 1.55 -1.24938737 1e-6
